<%- include('../partials/head') %>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="wrap wrap--read">
    <p class="eyebrow">The studio</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Naina Beauty Parlour — Salon Make-up Studio</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A beauty parlour on College Road in Bagurai, Jagannathpur, serving the town and the surrounding
      Bhadrak area since <%= salon.since %>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
    <div>
      <h2 id="what-title">What the studio is known for</h2>
      <p>
        Function and bridal work is the heart of the parlour: wedding-day makeup, reception looks,
        engagement and party makeup, the saree drape that goes with it, and the hair styling that
        finishes the day. Around that sits everyday parlour work — threading and waxing, facials and
        clean-ups, haircuts, colour, smoothing and keratin sessions, treatments for the lengths and
        scalp, brow and eyelid styling, and contact-lens and lash work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because the same team does both the wedding mornings and the walk-in threading, the diary is
        kept tight. That is why this booking page shows only the times that are genuinely free, and why
        a request is confirmed by the studio rather than automatic.
      </p>
      <p>
        Prices are not published here. Chair time is: each service lists the minutes the studio holds
        for it, which is what decides which slots you can take.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card--accent">
      <h3 class="card__title">At a glance</h3>
      <ul class="info-list">
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Since</strong> <%= salon.since %></p></li>
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Groups</strong> <%= stats.categories %> service categories</p></li>
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Bookable online</strong> <%= stats.bookable %> services</p></li>
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Opens</strong> <%= salon.opensAtLabel %></p></li>
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Phone</strong> <a href="tel:<%= salon.phoneHref %>"><%= salon.phone %></a></p></li>
        <li><span class="marker" aria-hidden="true">·</span><p><strong>Address</strong> <%= salon.address %></p></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="form-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="<%= salon.mapsUrl %>" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Directions</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/services">Service list</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="inclusion" aria-labelledby="inclusion-title">
  <div class="wrap wrap--read">
    <p class="eyebrow">Welcome note</p>
    <h2 id="inclusion-title">Book as yourself</h2>
    <p>
      The catalogue leads with women’s beauty services because that is what the studio does most of.
      Booking does not ask what gender you are. There is no gender field, no assumption in the form,
      and the optional title box accepts Ms., Mr., Mx. or anything else you would like the team to use.
    </p>
    <p>
      LGBTQ+ clients are welcome — for a function look, a threading session, bridal work for a partner
      or family member, or anything else on the list. If you would rather talk to the studio before
      booking, call <a href="tel:<%= salon.phoneHref %>"><%= salon.phone %></a> and ask; the team will tell
      you plainly whether a service is something they can do for you on the day.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your details are used for the appointment only: the studio sees your name, number and note so it
      can confirm the time. Nothing is sold or shared, and payment is not taken through this website.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--panel" aria-labelledby="expect-title">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--3">
    <div>
      <h2 id="expect-title">Before you come</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Arrive a few minutes before your slot so the chair time is used fully.</li>
        <li>Carry the reference number from your account page if you booked online.</li>
        <li>For colour, smoothing and lash work, the studio asks what you have used before — tell them at the appointment.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Changing a booking</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Cancel from your account and the time goes back into the diary for someone else.</li>
        <li>Then take a new slot, or call the studio and the team will move it for you.</li>
        <li>Same-day bookings need the notice period listed on the booking page.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Questions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Phone the studio: <a href="tel:<%= salon.phoneHref %>"><%= salon.phone %></a>.</li>
        <li>Directions: <a href="<%= salon.mapsUrl %>" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Maps</a>.</li>
        <li>Find the page here: <a href="/location">Find us</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
